{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>由楊偉倫（阿卵）和鍾雪瑩主演的電影《善男信女》，票房已經衝破400萬，團隊拍片感謝觀眾，並盼觀眾繼續入場支持《善男信女》，阿卵說：「希望《善男信女》嘅票房可以再行遠啲，多謝大家支持。」鍾雪瑩表示：「多謝﹗戲院見。」</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.616886+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T11:31:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:27:35.873954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.527262+00:00","content_hash":"0ccbaeb669669fed740899a52f01db7d0bc25e80d18674574e50f095d92f3e19","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}